WEBVTT

1
00:00:11,500 --> 00:00:14,100
Brother Qin, look, is there anything else missing?

2
00:00:14,100 --> 00:00:16,100
Banquet wine, sugar and tea are all hard brands.

3
00:00:16,100 --> 00:00:18,500
The fabric for the back pillow is also carefully selected.

4
00:00:18,500 --> 00:00:20,700
I guarantee that your wedding will be a success

5
00:00:20,700 --> 00:00:23,330
Director Liu took the trouble. The stuff is very good.

6
00:00:23,330 --> 00:00:29,390
The remaining money will be settled as we agreed.

7
00:00:29,390 --> 00:00:31,990
Do you want me to find someone to send you back?

8
00:00:31,990 --> 00:00:33,790
No, I can do it myself

9
00:00:33,790 --> 00:00:44,540
The wedding is worthless

10
00:00:44,540 --> 00:00:54,300
Now the machinery factory has 10,000 kilograms of grain.

11
00:00:54,300 --> 00:00:56,100
Brother Qin, sit down quickly

12
00:00:56,100 --> 00:00:59,100
I have a letter over there. This is why I came here.

13
00:00:59,100 --> 00:01:00,100
Brother, Brother
